     "listener_third: tn_mb_oriel_marshditch to tn_lf_moss_downridge: When I've a second room off the yard, Moss Downridge comes with me, if the wage is right.",
     "listener_third: tn_oh_ludo_ashwood to cty_nell_plummeadow: Nell Plummeadow counts every cup back on its hook. I wash every one twice. We get on, the pair of us.",
     "listener_third: tn_oh_ludo_ashwood to cty_nell_plummeadow: Fair. Fen-sure. And nobody runs Nell Plummeadow down in my hearing, mind."
